          "type": "TArray<TPair<FAttributeKey,FAttributeKey>>&"
        }
      ],
      "returnType": "Void",
      "docs": "Copy an array of attributes from the source storage to the destination storage. If the attribute already exists in the destination, the value will be updated.\nIf a key does not exist in the source it will not be copied/created in the destination.\n@param SourceStorage - The storage source.\n@param DestinationStorage - The storage destination.\n@param SrcDestAttributeKeys - All attributes that must be copied from the source to the destination, with a new key name."
    },
